---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import SpotlightCard from '../components/react/SpotlightCard';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`报告问题 - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="提交反馈或报告 Bug" />
		<style>
			main {
				width: 100%;
				max-width: 960px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 3rem 1rem;
			}
            .page-header {
                text-align: center;
                margin-bottom: 3rem;
            }
            .page-header h1 {
                font-size: 2.5em;
                margin-bottom: 0.5em;
            }
            .page-header p {
                font-size: 1.2em;
                color: var(--text-secondary);
                max-width: 600px;
                margin: 0 auto;
            }
			.issue-container {
                /* Container logic only */
			}
            .cards-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
                gap: 2rem;
            }
			.option-content {
				padding: 2rem;
                height: 100%;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                text-align: center;
			}
            .icon-wrapper {
                background: var(--gray-light);
                padding: 1rem;
                border-radius: 50%;
                margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
                color: var(--accent);
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
            }
			.option-content h3 {
				margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
				color: var(--text-heading);
                font-size: 1.5em;
			}
            .option-content p {
                flex-grow: 1;
                color: var(--text-secondary);
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
                line-height: 1.6;
            }
			.btn {
				display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 0.5em;
				background-color: var(--accent);
				color: white;
				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
				text-decoration: none;
				border-radius: 99px; /* Rounded pill shape */
				font-weight: bold;
                transition: all 0.2s ease;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
			}
			.btn:hover {
				background-color: var(--accent-dark);
                transform: translateY(-2px);
                box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
                color: white;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
            <div class="page-header">
                <h1>报告问题与反馈</h1>
                <p>如果您在使用过程中遇到任何问题，或有改进建议，请通过以下方式告诉我们。</p>
            </div>
			
			<div class="issue-container">
                <div class="cards-grid">
                    <SpotlightCard client:visible>
                        <div class="option-content">
                            <div class="icon-wrapper">
                                <Icon name="lucide:github" width="32" height="32" />
                            </div>
                            <h3>提交 Bug</h3>
                            <p>如果您发现了程序错误、显示异常，或者有功能建议，请在 GitHub 上提交 Issue。</p>
                            <a href="https://github.com/dreamreflex/blog/issues" target="_blank" class="btn">
                                <Icon name="lucide:external-link" width="18" height="18" />
                                前往 GitHub Issues
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </SpotlightCard>

                    <SpotlightCard client:visible>
                        <div class="option-content">
                            <div class="icon-wrapper">
                                <Icon name="lucide:mail" width="32" height="32" />
                            </div>
                            <h3>邮件联系</h3>
                            <p>如果您有其他问题、商务合作意向，或不便使用 GitHub，可以直接发送邮件给我们。</p>
                            <a href="mailto:phil616@163.com" class="btn">
                                <Icon name="lucide:send" width="18" height="18" />
                                发送邮件
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </SpotlightCard>
                </div>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>